        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCT1lYVk5kMGxTTldwSlNsUkhUVkJSUzFSbGJXYxAB!2m1!1s0x3403f95cd9dfecab:0x899dd608fbce187a"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJq-zf2Vz5AzQRehjO-wjWnYk/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xkR1UwWTBMV3BKVkZSSlJVMUxYMkZLT1RRM1JIYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "對上一次去深井食燒鵝已經係二十年前，當年嘅味道一直留喺記憶入面。相隔多年再次品嚐，雖然仍然保留到燒鵝應有嘅香味與做法，但整體水準始終難以同當年相比，更多嘅，反而係一種回憶加持下嘅情懷。\n\nThe last time I had roast goose in Sham Tseng was over 20 years ago, and the taste has stayed in my memory ever since. Returning after many years, while the roast goose still carries its familiar aroma and traditional preparation, the overall quality is hard to compare with what it once was. What remains stronger today may be the sense of nostalgia rather than the flavour itself.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "對上一次去深井食燒鵝已經係二十年前，當年嘅味道一直留喺記憶入面。相隔多年再次品嚐，雖然仍然保留到燒鵝應有嘅香味與做法，但整體水準始終難以同當年相比，更多嘅，反而係一種回憶加持下嘅情懷。\n\nThe last time I had roast goose in Sham Tseng was over 20 years ago, and the taste has stayed in my memory ever since. Returning after many years, while the roast goose still carries its familiar aroma and traditional preparation, the overall quality is hard to compare with what it once was. What remains stronger today may be the sense of nostalgia rather than the flavour itself.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
